.TH LIBMPQ__WRITER_FINISH 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__writer_finish \- finish an MPQ file writer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.sp
.BI "int32_t libmpq__writer_finish(mpq_writer_s *" "writer" ");"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates the declared size, writes the file sectors and records its hash and
block entry. Incomplete streams are rejected. This call consumes the writer
on both success and failure; do not reuse it afterward.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns \fBLIBMPQ_SUCCESS\fP when the member entry is staged, or a
negative libmpq error. Archive publication still requires
\fBlibmpq__archive_close\fP().
.SH ERRORS
NULL writers return \fBLIBMPQ_ERROR_EXIST\fP; an incomplete stream returns
\fBLIBMPQ_ERROR_SIZE\fP. Compression, allocation, and I/O errors may also
propagate.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libmpq (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_create (3),
.BR libmpq__archive_create_mpqe (3),
